+  **8. This is the year of the generalist (and maybe the year of those with ADHD)**. Boris’s work has shifted from deep-focus single-threaded coding to managing multiple parallel agents and context-switching rapidly. As Boris put it: “It’s not so much about deep work, it’s about how good I am at context switching and jumping across multiple different contexts very quickly.” ^993928588  
