+  AI is going to amplify that or can amplify that. So I I personally think this is this is the golden age of the junior programmer. I get people coming to me all the time, oh my son started his second year in CS and he wants to go into something more commercial like art history. And I I'd say this is like if you're a carpenter and they just introduced the the circular saw and you think ah well  
