+# About  
+  
+Title: [[Welcome to the Room|Welcome to the Room]]  
+Authors: [[Jeffrey Snover|Jeffrey Snover]]  
+Category: #articles  
+Tags: #leadership, #Startups  
+Number of Highlights: ==7==  
+Source URL: https://www.jsnover.com/blog/2026/02/01/welcome-to-the-room/  
